      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-316071",
      ":question/problem": "A pharmacy buys electric toothbrushes at a set wholesale cost and sells them at a retail price that is $275%$ of the wholesale cost. During clearance, each remaining toothbrush is sold at a discounted price. The retail price is $120%$ of the discounted price. If the discounted price of a toothbrush is $53.90$, what is the discounted price of an electric toothbrush?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
