      ":question/problem": "A movie ticket has a set regular price. During a special promotion, the ticket is sold at a price that is $40%$ less than the regular price. The promotional sale price is $130%$ of the theater's cost per ticket. If the theater's cost per ticket is $$3.60$, what was the regular price for each ticket?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
